# {{.ProjectName}}

This is a Go Monolith Layered API project using Gin and GORM, generated with `api-kit`.

## Requirements
- Go 1.22+

## Run
To run the application locally:
```bash
go mod tidy
go run cmd/api/main.go
```

## Structure
- `cmd/api/main.go`: Application entry point and router setup.
- `pkg/bootstrap`: Database and logger initialization.
- `internal/domain`: Domain models (Entities).
- `internal/user`: User layer containing Repository, Service, and Endpoints (Controllers).

## Endpoints
- `GET /users`
- `GET /users/:id`
- `POST /users`
- `PATCH /users/:id`
- `DELETE /users/:id`
